Third-party notice
------------------

The MIT license above covers the original code in this repository. It does NOT
cover third-party components, which keep their own licenses:

* RTMP streaming extension -- NOT distributed here.

  Upstream: https://github.com/lipku/python_rtmpstream (the C++/pybind11
  extension this project modifies). Its license could not be verified when this
  repository was prepared: the code hosting sites were unreachable from the
  build environment (their hostnames resolved to non-public addresses). To avoid
  redistributing a work whose terms are unknown, the modified copy has been
  excluded from this repository (see .gitignore, and "第三方组件与来源" in
  README.md). Obtain it from upstream yourself and comply with upstream's terms.

* Model weights (MuseTalk, SD-VAE, Whisper, wav2lip, DWPose, SFD, MediaPipe,
  face-parse-bisent) are NOT distributed here. Each has its own license; obtain
  them from their upstream projects and comply with those terms.

* FFmpeg and MediaMTX are external programs, used through their normal public
  interfaces and not bundled here.

